    "text": "In&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>AM</mi></math> modulation, a signal is modulated on a carrier wave such that maximum and minimum amplitude are found to be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>&nbsp;respectively. The modulation index is",
